    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "To celebrate 500,000,000 subscribers I invited 50 creators that built YouTube to compete for $1,000,000 for their subs!\n\nRoman Atwood, Casey Neistat, Captain Sparkles, Fousey, Ricegum, Vanoss Gaming, and so many more OGs :D",
