      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T16:24:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why did I tweet this",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2059020748090421284",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:16:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I hope everyone that came out for the live filming of a Beast Games S3 episode had a great time! Very grateful for all of you \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2058777725901398217",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T05:10:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When I was a kid all I wanted to do was build mini military forts all day",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2052607468073591076",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T04:32:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Here is how many views we got on YouTube every year of my life from age 12 to now 28. I love sharing this because it shows what happens if you find what you love and go all in. Grateful for all of you \u2764\ufe0f\n\nAge/Views\n12 -15,000\n13 -7,000\n14 -41,148\n15 -125,634\n16 -202,000\n17 -5,482,596\n18 -122,441,813\n19 -464,282,517\n20 -2,099,879,911\n21 -3,324,451,660\n22 -8,184,185,544\n23 -13,265,311,414\n24 -19,135,206,772\n25 -32,686,259,082\n26 -36,436,299,644\n27 -45,466,751,493\n28 -Just getting started \ud83e\udd2a",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2052397180363612217",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T14:36:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Happy Birthday MrBeast! \ud83c\udf89",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2052394981613048115",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T14:27:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ummm, I don\u2019t think people read this correctly \ud83d\ude05",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2050535024399729036",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T11:17:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If this tweet has exactly 1 like in 24 hours I\u2019ll give that person $1,000,000",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2050240914874826871",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T15:48:20+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I want to give a massive shout out to Disney. Once a year when I have Make A Wish requests they let us use their parks to give the kids the greatest days of their lives. We recreate our videos in the park and Disney goes so above and beyond to make the kids happy. Very grateful\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2049931545335718346",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T19:19:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grew up watching Survivor, so getting to be a part of it tonight was a big moment to me. This show isn\u2019t about celebrity, it\u2019s about the stakes and the competition, which is why I tried to lay back and keep the focus on the competitors. I hope you all love it :)",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2049671982359429345",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T02:07:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Everyone on earth takes a private vote by pressing a red or blue button. If more than 50% of people press the blue button, everyone survives. If less than 50% of people press the blue button, only people who pressed the red button survive. Which button would you press? BE HONEST.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2049273335742435617",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-28T23:43:31+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "mrbeast",
      "voiceName": "MrBeast",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Wasn\u2019t sure how you guys would like this gaming video but it had our highest retention and most views in 24 hours ever lol\n\nGonna do more chill videos like this with the boys :D",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MrBeast/status/2043423663102591180",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-12T20:19:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
